message: "If you use these tables, cite this release: DOI 10.5281/zenodo.24288113."
title: "EEO Archive, release 2026-11-15: public tables of the Repetition and Discernibility Audit"
type: dataset
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.24288113"
authors:
  - name: "Embodied Evaluation Observatory"
version: "2026-11-15"
date-released: "2026-11-15"
license: "CC-BY-4.0"
notes: >-
  CC-BY-4.0 covers the compilation and the computed statistics only. Per-attempt result
  fields remain under the terms of the source archive; the sealed source bytes are not
  redistributed. See LICENSE-DATA.md.
url: "https://embodied-evaluation.org"
abstract: >-
  Per-attempt records of public robot evaluations, re-published as flat tables, together
  with the intra-cluster correlation estimates, design effects and effective sample sizes
  that follow from them. The observatory does not evaluate robots; it audits published
  evaluations for statistical reliability. Every quoted estimate can be recomputed from
  the published table with tools/verify_public.py.
keywords:
  - robot benchmarking
  - evaluation variance
  - intra-cluster correlation
  - design effect
  - zero-failure certification
  - rank stability
